  "entity_definitions": [
    {
      "definition_json": {
        "description": "GH #3749 / REQ-712, docs/assets/stock-workflow-documents.md sections 1.4 and 9.1, decision 0078 D5. The header of a stock receipt document. It is written only by module stock (managed type). document_id is the id of the versioned document of Letflow.Documents (decision 0056) that carries the state, the gap-free number and the issued time: no number, status, posted_at, posted_by or reversed_by_entry is stored here (they are read from the versioned document). org_unit_id is the issuing org unit (queried; the scope column of decision 0076 R7). event_time is the time of the receipt, ISO 8601 with offset, stored in UTC. location_id, responsible_id and counterparty_id are record ids of modules locations, org and catalog_items (other packs: no foreign key; the module checks them at issue). After issue nothing of the header changes.",
        "display_name": "Stock receipt (header)",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "document_id",
            "queried": true,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "event_time",
            "required": true,
            "type": "datetime"
          },
          {
            "name": "org_unit_id",
            "queried": true,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "location_id",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "responsible_id",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "counterparty_id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "note",
            "type": "string"
          }
        ],
        "indexes": [
          {
            "fields": [
              "document_id"
            ],
            "name": "idx_stock_receipt_document_id"
          }
        ],
        "name": "stock_receipt"
      },
      "display_name": "Stock receipt (header)",
      "entity_definition_id": "0c25df3d-6843-d3bc-fd43-d9562afe1966",
      "logical_shape_version": "b816d2c1b026a5bf7f9845e050027ee908aae6f5212f26ef0a505a5dc2192c91",
      "name": "stock_receipt"
    },
    {
      "definition_json": {
        "description": "GH #3749 / REQ-712, docs/assets/stock-workflow-documents.md sections 1.4 and 9.3. One line of a stock receipt. header_id is the record_id of the stock_receipt header (not the document id); the foreign_keys entry fk_stock_receipt_line_header_id promotes it to a uuid column with ON DELETE RESTRICT (inert on the soft-delete path). org_unit_id is the header's value copied by the module (queried; the scope column of decision 0076 R7, so a scoped read can filter lines). line_no is the position 1..n. quantity is an exact decimal (precision 24, scale 9, decimal_strict). catalog_item_id, catalog_uom_id and catalog_lot_id are record ids of module catalog_items (another pack: no foreign key; the module checks them at issue). Written only by module stock; after issue nothing of a line changes.",
        "display_name": "Stock receipt (line)",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "header_id",
            "queried": true,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "org_unit_id",
            "queried": true,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "line_no",
            "required": true,
            "type": "integer"
          },
          {
            "name": "catalog_item_id",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "catalog_uom_id",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "catalog_lot_id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "decimal_precision": 24,
            "decimal_scale": 9,
            "decimal_strict": true,
            "name": "quantity",
            "required": true,
            "type": "decimal"
          }
        ],
        "foreign_keys": [
          {
            "field": "header_id",
            "name": "fk_stock_receipt_line_header_id",
            "references_entity": "stock_receipt"
          }
        ],
        "indexes": [
          {
            "fields": [
              "header_id"
            ],
            "name": "idx_stock_receipt_line_header_id"
          }
        ],
        "name": "stock_receipt_line"
      },
      "display_name": "Stock receipt (line)",
      "entity_definition_id": "450d0aee-6502-e643-a766-5d4bb96c2171",
      "logical_shape_version": "ff0b60bedec9880289aa52307b99e642c83997794a2277798f726f612940722b",
      "name": "stock_receipt_line"
    },
    {
      "definition_json": {
        "constraints": [
          {
            "fields": [
              "document_id",
              "mark"
            ],
            "name": "uq_stock_posting_mark_doc_mark",
            "type": "unique"
          }
        ],
        "description": "GH #3748 / REQ-713, decision 0073 (Consequences, cost note), docs/assets/stock-workflow-documents.md section 9.2. The bookkeeping record that says a stock document was posted (mark posted) or reversed (mark reversed). It is written only by the write handlers post_document and reverse_document of module stock, in the same transaction as the ledger entry (HandlerWrites.create/3 and post/3). document_id is the id of the versioned document, document_type its type key, version_no the issued version, org_unit_id the issuing org unit (queried; the scope column of decision 0076 R7), reason_code the reversal reason (set on a reversed mark only). The unique constraint uq_stock_posting_mark_doc_mark allows one posted and one reversed mark per document: a second completion of a posting for the same document violates it, so the whole completion transaction rolls back before any ledger write.",
        "display_name": "Stock posting mark",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "document_id",
            "queried": true,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "document_type",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "version_no",
            "required": true,
            "type": "integer"
          },
          {
            "enum_values": [
              "posted",
              "reversed"
            ],
            "name": "mark",
            "queried": true,
            "required": true,
            "type": "enum"
          },
          {
            "name": "org_unit_id",
            "queried": true,
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "reason_code",
            "type": "string"
          }
        ],
        "name": "stock_posting_mark"
      },
      "display_name": "Stock posting mark",
      "entity_definition_id": "90d68b14-3e26-d901-3bae-8df41d7ded1c",
      "logical_shape_version": "158f5ad15f8ff031368fad400283663f06bf46ed2e05ee6dec54a818eb6d4ed3",
